Changes to version 1.0.0
------------------------

Connection
- MMS connect / disconnect over TCP (port 102) and TLS (port 443)
- Recent connections list, persisted in iedclient_config.xml
- Connection-lost modal and event log

Data model
- Full IEC 61850 model browser: LD, LN, DO, DA, SubAttribute
- FC-aware tree (correct handling of duplicate DA names per FC)
- Live values for ST and MX attributes with quality and timestamps
- IED tree page with recursive dot-path filter
- Per-device watchlist, persisted in iedclient_config.xml

Logical Devices
- LD grid with Mod / Beh / Health / Sim / Blk status indicators
- LD properties panel and right-click navigation to LN / DS / RCB

Logical Nodes
- STATE tab with sortable, copyable signal table
- CONTROLS tab: Direct and SBO control models
- Control dialog with Origin (orCat / orIdent), Test, Interlock, Synchrocheck
- CommandTermination handler for Enhanced Security models (ctlModel 3, 4)
- SETTINGS tab: SP / SE / SG attributes, double-click to write
- Setting Group Control Block (SGCB) panel: Set Active SG, Start Edit, Confirm Edit, Cancel Edit
- TREE tab with per-LN DO / DA / SubAttribute hierarchy

DataSets
- Browse datasets across all LDs with live signal values
- [object] expansion for structured values

Reports / GOOSE / SV
- BRCB and URCB enable / disable, configure RptID, DataSet, TrgOps, BufTm, IntgPd
- Async report reception with per-RCB storage (100-entry circular buffer)
- GOOSE control blocks: GoID and DataSet editable, network params read-only
- Sampled Values control blocks: enable / disable
- Arrow-button navigation from RCB / GOOSE / SV panels to bound dataset

Files
- IED file system browse with sortable name / size / date columns
- Download with per-row progress
- Delete with confirmation

UI / UX
- Tab navigation with Alt+1..7 shortcuts
- Global F5 refresh, F11 fullscreen, F1 / Ctrl+H about
- Ctrl+C copies any selected table row
- Ctrl+E opens event log
- Embedded Noto Sans Mono for consistent rendering
- TX / RX byte counters in status bar

Tooling
- MMS Dump tool: snapshot IED data model to text file
- Crash reporting via Google Breakpad with separately published symbol archives

Build / packaging
- Linux: AppImage, .deb, .rpm
- Windows: portable .zip
- Docker-based reproducible builds via ci/build_local.sh
